Next week, we'll come back and talk about some specialized architectures for face recognition

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:35.250
and for your style transfer, where you get to create some really interesting artwork using

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:36.890
neural networks.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.410
Have fun in the program exercise and I look forward to seeing you next week.
